\par\par \b \uc2  SIMEX Euroyen steady, JGBs firm as Nikkei sags. \b0\par\par\uc2 376 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 1999\par 11:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Sept 16 (Reuters) - SIMEX Euroyen futures were \par \par \uc2  steady in light Thursday trade while Japanese government bond \par \par \uc2  (JGB) futures gained from investors fleeing the stock market on \par \par \uc2  concern over the rising yen. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the credit market was also mildly supported by \par \par \uc2  speculation that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would succumb to further \par \par \uc2  easing via "unsterilised" \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Most dealers were not convinced that the BOJ would loosen \par \par \uc2  its already slack grip on monetary policy, but they said the \par \par \uc2  yen's relentless rise reduced the likelihood of a tightening \par \par \uc2  despite recent signs Japan's economy might be on the mend. \par \par \uc2      "If they raised interest rates now, they'd be killing off \par \par \uc2  the recovery. And if they don't do anything on dollar/yen, it \par \par \uc2  will really hurt the Nikkei," said a trader at an Asian \par \par \uc2  institution. \par \par \uc2      BOJ governor Masaru Hayami squashed hopes of a shift in the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's approach, saying the present policy of guiding \par \par \uc2  short-term rates virtually to zero was more than adequate to \par \par \uc2  meet funding needs. \par \par \uc2      He also said after a meeting with Finance Minister Kiichi \par \par \uc2  Miyazawa that there was no change to the BOJ's policy on \par \par \uc2  sterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      SIMEX TIBOR EUROYEN Contract...... DEC9........... \par \par \uc2  MAR0......