\par\par \b \uc2  Snr Treasury, Central Bk Officials Meet As Yen Advances \b0\par\par\uc2 394 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 1999\par 15:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  PARIS (Dow Jones)--Senior treasury and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials from the world's 11 biggest economies are meeting here Tuesday, with a stand-in chairman presiding over the group's regular talks on economic and financial issues which this time are likely to reflect concern about the yen's recent strength against the dollar and euro. \par \par \uc2  The yen's strength - the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has risen 12% against the dollar in the past two months - is threatening to stymie Japan's economic recovery by hampering exports. \par \par \uc2  The slide of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the yen stalled in early New York trading Tuesday, but traders believe the impact of overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the rally will likely be shortlived, with the dollar to fall below JPY106.00. \par \par \uc2  Japan's Vice Minister of Finance for International Affairs Haruhiko Kuroda is leading his country's delegation to the Working Party Three (WP3) meeting. A Japanese delegation member said only relatively junior officials are attending from the Bank of Japan. \par \par \uc2  WP3 is the name given to the group of officials who meet regularly to discuss fiscal, monetary, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and balance of payments problems at the headquarters of the Organization of Economic Cooperation and Development. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's WP3 meeting is being chaired by Jean-Jaques Rey, a director at Belgium's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rather than the U.S. deputy treasury secretary who traditionally fills the role. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. delegation is being led by U.S. Treasury Undersecretary for International Affairs Timothy Geithner following the promotion of Lawrence Summers, former Deputy Treasury Secretary and WP3 Chairman, to the position of Treasury Secretary earlier this year. Stuart Eizenstadt succeeded Summers as Deputy Treasury Secretary. \par \par \uc2  As has happened on previous occasions, the WP3 meeting is likely to be followed by an informal meeting of deputies from the Group of Seven (G7) industrialized nations, with the yen's strength also likey to figure prominently. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's discussions are part of the preparations for the regular gathering of G7 finance ministers that will occur in Washington Sept. 25, on the sidelines of the World Bank/International Monetary Fund annual meeting. \par \par \uc2  The WP3's members include the U.S., Japan, Germany, France, Italy, the U.K., Canada, the Netherlands, Sweden and Switzerland. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-09-99 \par \par \uc2  1301GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9e06q9y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
